    HostConfigurationService --> AgentTypeEnablementService : uses
    ToolsController --> ToolInvoker : uses
    TestController --> IScenarioFactory : uses
    TestController --> CurrentScenarioStore : uses
    CodeGraphController --> ICodeGraphContextAccessor : uses
    ChatSessionsController --> SqliteSessionStore : uses
    VisualizationController --> SqliteSessionStore : uses
    VisualizationController --> SqliteTraceTimelineStore : uses
